WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.180
Unit fourteen. Drug Awareness!

2
00:00:04.086 --> 00:00:07.667
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.717 --> 00:00:10.691
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:13.911
Today we learn about Drug Awareness. Let's go!

5
00:00:14.861 --> 00:00:18.195
Drugs. Say it with me. Drugs!

6
00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:25.066
Addiction. Say it with me. Addiction!

7
00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:31.642
Brain. Say it with me. Brain!

8
00:00:35.151 --> 00:00:38.717
Mental health. Say it with me. Mental health!

9
00:00:42.271 --> 00:00:45.805
Risk. Say it with me. Risk!

10
00:00:49.295 --> 00:00:52.295
Law. Say it with me. Law!

11
00:00:55.739 --> 00:00:59.439
Refuse. Say it with me. Refuse!

12
00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:05.845
Help. Say it with me. Help!

13
00:01:09.364 --> 00:01:20.712
Illegal drugs can change how the brain works and harm mental health. They carry a high risk of addiction and legal trouble under the law. Refuse offers and get help if someone is in danger.

14
00:01:20.762 --> 00:01:23.183
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:23.926 --> 00:01:29.172
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.372
Brain!

17
00:01:31.088 --> 00:01:36.105
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.155 --> 00:01:37.305
Refuse!

19
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:43.231
Did you know? Drugs bought illegally can contain unknown and dangerous substances!

20
00:01:43.281 --> 00:01:45.329
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.705 --> 00:01:54.693
Think and answer. How could you get help for a friend who is using drugs?

22
00:01:54.743 --> 00:01:55.893
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.982 --> 00:02:01.664
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.714 --> 00:02:04.377
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

